        "---\n",
        "title: \"Clustering Ablation: Liked Items vs Perfect Samples Only\"\n",
        "description: |\n",
        "  Does including liked items in Ward cluster medoid construction change the LR model's\n",
        "  AUC/logLoss vs using perfect samples alone? A Sacred experiment comparing two clustering\n",
        "  conditions on identical training rows/labels, differing only in the medoids (and hence the\n",
        "  n:d1 distance-to-medoid feature).\n",
        "execute:\n",
        "  echo: true\n",
        "  warning: false\n",
        "  message: false\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  html:\n",
        "    embed-resources: true\n",
        "    toc: true\n",
        "    toc-depth: 2\n",
        "jupyter: python3\n",
        "---"
      ],
